data-contracts.session-shape:
type SessionStatus = 'scheduled' | 'completed' | 'cancelled'
interface Session { id: string; title: string; status: SessionStatus; startsAt: string }
id is an opaque technical key for React (not displayed, not a product field). startsAt is an ISO 8601 UTC string, e.g. 2026-11-02T09:30:00.000Z. No other fields.

data-contracts.api-surface:
interface NewSessionInput { title: string; startsAt: string }  // title already trimmed, startsAt ISO UTC
interface SessionsApi { listSessions(): Promise<Session[]>; createSession(input: NewSessionInput): Promise<Session> }
The status of a new session is assigned by the API (DEFAULT_STATUS), as a real backend would.
